SUMOylation
For
in vitro
SUMOylation, recombinant SUMO E1, SUMO E2 (UBC9), SUMO-1 and SUMO-2 were purchased from Enzo Life Sciences (Lausen, Switzerland). Reactions were performed for 2 h at 30°C in
in vitro
buffer [20 mM Tris-HCl pH 7.6, 50 mM NaCl, 10 mM MgCl
2
, 0.1 mM dithiothreitol (DTT), 1× protease inhibitor cocktail (cOmplete™, Mini, EDTA-free Protease Inhibitor Cocktail, Roche) with or without 4 mM ATP] as described previously (
